# Copy to web/.env.local (git ignored) and fill in.
#
# Spotify Client ID for the conductor's play-along sign-in. Create an app at
# https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard, tick "Web API" and "Web Playback SDK",
# and add the redirect URI http://127.0.0.1:5173/spotify/callback (Spotify
# rejects 'localhost'; add your https origin + /spotify/callback when deployed).
# A Client ID is public (PKCE, no client secret), but keep it out of the repo
# so each developer uses their own. Development Mode allows 5 users, Premium only.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
